// java_system_modules module — a java_library stub would fail Soong's type check —
// so this stub IS a java_system_modules. Its libs list holds our own empty
// core-lambda-stubs-for-system-modules stub (defined above) so the list is non-empty
// and always resolves. Upstream it aggregates frameworks/base's system modules
// (unsynced); the referencers are host tools never built here, so the aggregation is
// irrelevant — only the NAME and the TYPE have to exist for Soong's parse.
