// Runs #125/#126/#127 fix: the #122/#123/#124 fix HELD in
// all three (prune step passed + pre-build guard passed).
// All three fail at Soong ninja generation, ~35-37s into
// the build step, on the SAME fix code (head 205ec0a - the
// #122/#123/#124 fix, workflow aa3581b). Subset-reporting
// again, at its extreme: #125 reports 10 lines, #126
// reports 4, #127 reports 2 - all different subsets of one
// commit. The fix covers the UNION (12 distinct error
// lines, 8 distinct modules; #127's 2 lines are a subset
// of #126's 4; #126's 4 are #125's libcap pair plus the
// new libaconfigd_protos_rust pair).
// Raw-log verbatim (job-logs.txt, genuine build-output
// lines only - the other "error:" matches in each log are
// the runner echoing the Build step script itself, the
// pre-build-guard echo commands that did NOT fire, NOT
// build errors). The FAILED line is
// out/soong/build.yuzora_lights.ninja (not build.ninja).
// No genuine "missing variant" line in any of the three
// runs - "missing variant" appears only inside the quoted
// comment blocks in the build script.
//   #125 (45875772540, 15m16s, auto, manifest ce8b2b9) -
//   10 lines: libinit_host + host_init_verifier need
//   libcap; libzipalign needs libzopfli; libfastboot2
//   needs avb_headers + bootimg_headers + libadb_host;
//   libutils_binder_test needs liblzma; libfastboot needs
//   bootimg_headers + avb_headers + platform_tools_version.
//   #126 (45875913306, 13m52s, auto, README 205ec0a) -
//   4 lines: libinit_host + host_init_verifier need
//   libcap; aflags + aflags.test need
//   libaconfigd_protos_rust.
//   #127 (45876399917, 14m53s, manual ~00:00 IST,
//   205ec0a) - 2 lines: aflags + aflags.test need
//   libaconfigd_protos_rust.
//   NOTE on :line numbers: Soong's reported lines do NOT
//   reproduce in the live files - fastboot :47/:280 vs
//   live libfastboot2 at 89/91 and libfastboot at 521/523;
//   init :661/:631 vs live libinit_host at 1269/1271 and
//   host_init_verifier at 1211/1213; zipalign :21 vs live
//   libzipalign at 37/39. Verified at lineage-22.2 tip AND
//   the manifest-pinned HEAD bcb8623 (byte-identical for
//   both files), so this is Soong attributing through the
//   defaults: expansion, not version drift. Key the fix
//   off module names, not :line numbers (same caveat as
//   the #122 liblp/libapex paths and the #96/#107 misreads).
// Root causes, verified live at LineageOS lineage-22.2 /
// AOSP android-15.0.0_r32 (all 8 defining projects UNSYNCED):
// - libcap: whole_static_libs of init_host_defaults (used
//   by libinit_host + host_init_verifier) and
//   libinit_defaults. Upstream plain cc_library in
//   external/libcap/Android.bp (r32 ~lines 48-91,
//   host_supported, min_sdk_version 29) - external/libcap
//   NOT synced. Plain cc_library matches upstream and
//   covers any future shared_libs use (same precedent as
//   libz #119, libjsoncpp #105, libcrypto #122).
// - libzopfli: whole_static_libs of libzipalign
//   (cc_library_host_static). Upstream plain cc_library in
//   external/zopfli/Android.bp (r32 ~lines 20-50,
//   host_supported, export_include_dirs src) -
//   external/zopfli NOT synced.
// - avb_headers: header_libs of libfastboot2 + libfastboot
//   (via fastboot_host_defaults). Upstream
//   cc_library_headers in external/avb/Android.bp
//   (lineage-22.2 lines 838-870, host_supported,
//   export_include_dirs ".") - external/avb NOT synced.
//   Same file as libavb (#119, cc_library_static) and
//   libavb_host_sysdeps (#122, cc_library_host_static) -
//   three different modules, all stubbed now.
// - bootimg_headers: header_libs of libfastboot2 +
//   libfastboot (+ export_header_lib_headers) and of
//   libinit_defaults (line 449, not cited by any run -
//   subset reporting). Upstream cc_library_headers in
//   system/tools/mkbootimg/Android.bp (r32 ~lines 7-22,
//   export_include_dirs include/bootimg, host_supported)
//   - system/tools/mkbootimg NOT synced (only
//   system/tools/aidl, hidl, xsdc are synced). NOT
//   system/core/mkbootimg - mkbootimg lives under
//   system/tools/.
// - libadb_host: static_libs of libfastboot2. Upstream
//   cc_library_host_static in packages/modules/adb/
//   Android.bp (r32 lines 536-538) - packages/modules/adb
//   NOT synced. NOT a prune casualty: system/core has no
//   adb/ dir at all at r32 or lineage-22.2 - adb moved out
//   of system/core to its own project. Stub mirrors the
//   upstream type (host-only by type, no host_supported -
//   same pattern as libavb_host_sysdeps #122).
// - liblzma: shared_libs (target.android) AND static_libs
//   (target.host) of libutils_binder_test - only plain
//   cc_library satisfies both. Upstream plain cc_library
//   in external/lzma/Android.bp (r32 ~lines 40-44,
//   host_supported) - external/lzma NOT synced.
// - platform_tools_version: generated_headers of
//   libfastboot. Upstream genrule in development/sdk/
//   Android.bp (r32 lines 42-52, out
//   platform_tools_version.h, seds
//   plat_tools_source.prop_template) - development NOT
//   synced. Stub genrule with the same out and a dummy
//   header cmd; it must NOT reference the template as a
//   src (that file is not in the tree). Same pattern as
//   the cxx-bridge-header genrule stub (#119).
// - libaconfigd_protos_rust: rustlibs of aflags.defaults
//   (inherited by rust_binary aflags + rust_test_host
//   aflags.test). Upstream rust_library in
//   packages/modules/ConfigInfrastructure/aconfigd/proto/
//   Android.bp (r32 lines 108-126, crate_name
//   aconfigd_protos, defaults aconfigd_protos.defaults,
//   host_supported) - that project NOT synced. The daemon
//   lives under packages/modules/ConfigInfrastructure/
//   aconfigd/ (NOT build/make/tools/aconfig/aconfigd or
//   system/aconfigd - neither exists). Do NOT stub the
//   rust_protobuf libaconfigd_rust_proto separately - no
//   synced file references it; the stub carries no
//   rustlibs, so its generated-proto dep never surfaces.
//   Stub is rust_library with crate_name aconfigd_protos,
//   srcs lib.rs (reused from the #96 libcxx stub),
//   edition 2021.
cc_library {
    name: "libcap",
    srcs: ["empty.c"],
    host_supported: true,
    target: { windows: { enabled: true } },
    visibility: [
        "//visibility:public",
    ],
}
cc_library {
    name: "libzopfli",
    srcs: ["empty.c"],
    host_supported: true,
    target: { windows: { enabled: true } },
    visibility: [
        "//visibility:public",
    ],
}
cc_library_headers {
    name: "avb_headers",
    host_supported: true,
    visibility: [
        "//visibility:public",
    ],
}
cc_library_headers {
    name: "bootimg_headers",
    host_supported: true,
    visibility: [
        "//visibility:public",
    ],
}
cc_library_host_static {
    name: "libadb_host",
    srcs: ["empty.c"],
    target: { windows: { enabled: true } },
    visibility: [
        "//visibility:public",
    ],
}
cc_library {
    name: "liblzma",
    srcs: ["empty.c"],
    host_supported: true,
    target: { windows: { enabled: true } },
