// same content, parallel upload). Subset-reporting
// again: #134 reports 6 lines, #133 reports 4, #132
// reports 3, #131 reports 3 - the fix covers the UNION
// (7 distinct error lines, 6 distinct modules).
// Raw-log verbatim (live browser read of the job-logs.txt
// raw logs; genuine build-output lines only - the other
// "error:" matches in each log are the runner echoing the
// Build step script itself, the pre-build-guard echo
// commands that did NOT fire, NOT build errors). The
// FAILED line is out/soong/build.yuzora_lights.ninja (not
// build.ninja).
//   #134 (45895348416, 13m39s, manual ~02:32 IST,
//   d1733a2) - 6 lines: servicemanager_test
//   (frameworks/native/cmds/servicemanager/Android.bp:94)
//   + servicemanager_unittest (:105) need libvintf;
//   libutils_test (system/core/libutils/Android.bp:329)
//   needs libunwindstack_no_dex; host-apex-verifier
//   (system/apex/tools/Android.bp:122) needs
//   debugfs_static + fsck.erofs + the libpcre2 SHARED
//   variant (only static available).
//   #133 (45894592352, 14m42s, manual ~02:26 IST,
//   038d421) - 4 lines: libutils_test needs
//   libunwindstack_no_dex; liblogd
//   (system/logging/logd/Android.bp:57) needs
//   ILogcatManagerService_aidl; servicemanager_test +
//   servicemanager_unittest need libvintf.
//   #132 (45894278812, 14m59s, auto, README 038d421) -
//   3 lines: host-apex-verifier needs debugfs_static +
//   fsck.erofs + the libpcre2 SHARED variant.
//   #131 (45894154470, 14m40s, auto, manifest 94840c1) -
//   3 lines: libutils_test needs libunwindstack_no_dex;
//   servicemanager_test + servicemanager_unittest need
//   libvintf.
// PHANTOM CORRECTION: the first browser read of #134
// reported ILights.aidl / types.aidl /
// android.hardware.light@2.0 / vendor.qti.hardware.display
// lines - NONE occur in any of the four raw logs (a raw-log
// text search returns zero matches for ILights,
// types.aidl, vendor.qti.hardware.display and
// android.hardware.light@2.0; the light aidl_api has no
// types.aidl at lineage-22.2 and ILights.aidl has no
// imports). Same class as the #30/#33/#84/#96/#107
// misreads: UI-log reads invent error lines; the raw log
// is authoritative.
// Root causes, verified live at LineageOS lineage-22.2 /
// AOSP android-15.0.0_r32 (all 6 defining projects UNSYNCED):
// - libvintf: plain cc_library in system/libvintf/
//   Android.bp (r32, host_supported) - system/libvintf
//   NOT synced. Used in shared_libs by
//   servicemanager_defaults, which both test modules
//   inherit (neither names it directly).
// - libunwindstack_no_dex: cc_library_static in
//   system/unwinding/libunwindstack/Android.bp (r32,
//   static lib without DEX support, no libdexfile dep) -
//   system/unwinding NOT synced. Used in
//   target.host.static_libs by libutils_test (on Android
//   it uses shared libunwindstack instead, already
//   stubbed #128).
// - ILogcatManagerService_aidl: aidl_library in
//   frameworks/base/core/java/Android.bp (r32, lines
//   256-259, srcs android/os/logcat/
//   ILogcatManagerService.aidl) - frameworks/base NOT
//   synced. Used in aidl.libs by liblogd (a
//   cc_library_static), NOT in shared/static_libs - so
//   the stub must be a real aidl_library (a cc_library
//   stub would fail Soong's aidl.libs type check), with
//   a minimal valid .aidl source (empty interface;
//   liblogd is never compiled for this HAL-only target,
//   so only the module name has to exist for the parse).
// - debugfs_static: cc_binary (static_executable,
//   host_supported) in external/e2fsprogs/debugfs/
//   Android.bp (r32) - external/e2fsprogs NOT synced.
//   Used in data_bins by the sh_test_host
//   host-apex-verifier (NOT the cc_binary_host
//   host_apex_verifier) and in required: by deapexer /
//   apex_elf_checker / apexd_host in the same file.
// - fsck.erofs: cc_binary (host_supported) in
//   external/erofs-utils/Android.bp (r32) -
//   external/erofs-utils NOT synced. Same use as
//   debugfs_static.
// - libpcre2: the #78 cc_library_static stub provides
//   only the static variant, but host-apex-verifier
//   lists it in data_libs, which needs the SHARED
//   variant (os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:shared).
//   Upstream libpcre2 is plain cc_library in
//   external/pcre/Android.bp (r32, host_supported) -
//   external/pcre NOT synced. The stub changes type
//   (same fix as libz #119, libcrypto/libselinux #122).
