//   Android.bp:10) needs android.hardware.sensors-
//   V1-convert + android.frameworks.sensorservice-V1-ndk
//   + android.hardware.sensors-V3-ndk.
//   #140 (45907764291, 14m40s, manual ~04:25 IST, 8603eb6)
//   - 9 lines: the same 3 sensor lines PLUS libinput
//   (frameworks/native/libs/input/Android.bp:203) needs
//   libeigen + tensorflow_headers + libtflite_static +
//   libkernelconfigs +
//   android.companion.virtualdevice.flags-aconfig-cc +
//   libPlatformProperties.
