// :203:1 but the live file has libinput at line 387
// (:203 is inside libinput_bindgen's bindgen_flags) -
// Soong attributes through the defaults expansion again,
// so key the fix off module names, not :line numbers
// (same caveat as the #122 liblp/libapex paths and the
// #125 fastboot/init lines).
// Root causes, verified live at LineageOS lineage-22.2 /
// AOSP android-15.0.0_r32 (all defining projects UNSYNCED
// unless noted):
// - android.hardware.sensors-V1-convert: the generated
//   version-conversion C++ lib of the aidl_interface
//   android.hardware.sensors in hardware/interfaces/
//   sensors/aidl/Android.bp (lineage-22.2, versions_with_
//   info 1 + 2, frozen: false, cpp/java backends disabled,
//   ndk default-on, stability vintf) - hardware/interfaces
//   is synced but the closure prune keeps ONLY light/aidl
//   + compatibility_matrices + common/aidl + input/common/
//   aidl, so sensors/aidl is pruned. Used in static_libs
//   by libsensorserviceaidl (a plain cc_library), so a
//   plain cc_library stub satisfies it.
// - android.frameworks.sensorservice-V1-ndk: the generated
//   NDK lib of the aidl_interface
//   android.frameworks.sensorservice in frameworks/
//   hardware/interfaces/sensorservice/aidl/Android.bp
//   (aosp monorepo main: frozen version 1, cpp/java
//   backends disabled, ndk default-on, stability vintf,
//   srcs android/frameworks/sensorservice/*.aidl) -
//   frameworks/hardware/interfaces is NOT synced. Used in
//   shared_libs by libsensorserviceaidl, so a plain
//   cc_library stub satisfies it. (The interface imports
//   android.hardware.sensors-V2 - no stub for that: imports
//   of an unsynced interface never surface, only the three
//   modules synced code names directly.)
// - android.hardware.sensors-V3-ndk: the generated NDK lib
//   of the same android.hardware.sensors interface - with
//   frozen: false the current (unfrozen) version is V3.
//   Same project/prune story as -V1-convert. Used in
//   shared_libs by libsensorserviceaidl, so a plain
//   cc_library stub satisfies it.
// - libeigen: cc_library_headers in external/eigen/
//   Android.bp (export_include_dirs ["."]) - external/eigen
//   NOT synced. Used in header_libs (+ export_header_lib_
//   headers) by libinput; libtflite_framework also lists
//   it in header_libs, same stub covers both.
// - tensorflow_headers: cc_library_headers in external/
