//   vendor_available, host_supported, sdk_version current)
//   - external/tensorflow NOT synced. Used in header_libs
//   by libinput.
// - libtflite_static: cc_library_static in external/
//   tensorflow/tensorflow/lite/tflite_static.bp (r32,
//   host_supported, vendor_available, sdk_version current,
//   min_sdk_version 30, srcs :tflite_src) - external/
//   tensorflow NOT synced. Used in static_libs by libinput
//   (and by libtensorflowlite_jni); libinput's ldflags
//   reference libtflite_static.a, confirming the static
//   archive.
// - libkernelconfigs: cc_library_static in system/libvintf/
//   Android.bp (r32, defaults libvintf-defaults, host_
//   supported, recovery_available, srcs KernelConfigs.cpp
//   + KernelConfigParser.cpp, shared_libs libbase + libz)
//   - NOT kernel/configs: the synced kernel/configs tree
//   holds only config fragments + build rules, while
//   libkernelconfigs lives in system/libvintf, which is
//   NOT synced. Used in static_libs by libinput (and in
//   whole_static_libs by libvintf, stubbed plain in #131
