//   synced. Used in shared_libs by libinput; a
//   cc_aconfig_library generates a cc_library of the same
//   name, so a plain cc_library stub satisfies it (same as
//   the -aconfig-cc stubs in #122 / #128 / #135). The
//   sibling -java libs are NOT stubbed - no synced file
//   references them.
// - libPlatformProperties: Soong generates the cc_library
//   libPlatformProperties from the sysprop_library
//   "PlatformProperties" (android/sysprop/Platform-
//   Properties.sysprop, owner Platform) - one rust_library,
//   one java_library and one cc_library per sysprop_library
//   (source.android.com sysprops-apis doc). The defining
//   .bp file was NOT traced to a file this round (same
//   class as the #105 libgtest_isolated / libprocinfo
//   stubs - home not traced); a plain cc_library stub
//   satisfies the shared_libs use by libinput regardless
//   of which project defines it.
// COMPILE-STAGE CAVEAT: the two cc_library_headers stubs
// are bare (no export_include_dirs, no real headers), as
// all earlier headers stubs were. A bare stub passes
// Soong; dummy headers will be needed only if the next
// run fails at compile/link because libinput actually
// includes Eigen / tensorflow/lite headers (TfLiteMotion-
