// 5 plain cc_library — a plain cc_library yields both variants,
// so one stub satisfies the shared_libs and static_libs consumers
// alike; same form as the #156 allocator@2.0 stub and the #174
// health@2.1 stub. 2 are HIDL @x.y libs (sensors@2.0 + @2.1),
// 1 is an AIDL -ndk lib (common.fmq-V1-ndk), 1 is a plain library
// (libfmq, upstream cc_library in system/libfmq), 1 is a test
// utility (libtestUtil — upstream definition not located after
// bounded search, plain per the #182 libincremental_aidl-cpp and
// #186 libprotoutil precedent; consumed via static_libs by three
// in-graph test/benchmark modules).
// 1 cc_library_headers (android.hardware.sensors@2.X-shared-utils —
// upstream cc_library_headers, consumed via header_libs by
// libsensorservice; same form as libimapper_stablec /
// libimapper_providerutils in #194).
// 1 genrule (framework-cppstream-protos — upstream gensrcs in
// frameworks/base/ProtoLibraries.bp; Soong REQUIRES a
// SourceFileGenerator for generated_headers deps — build/soong/cc/
// cc.go errors "module %q is not a genrule" otherwise — so a plain
// cc_library stub would FAIL; genrule shape mirrors the
// cxx-bridge-header / platform_tools_version stubs already in
// this file).
